<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Update regarding your application</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f8fa;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 16px;
            -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid #eaeef2;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .email-header {
            padding: 32px 40px 0 40px;
        }
        .company-logo {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            color: #111111;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 32px 40px 40px 40px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            color: #4b5563;
        }
        p.greeting {
            color: #111111;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .signature {
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #f0f2f5;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4b5563;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .signature strong {
            color: #111111;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="company-logo">{{companyName}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
            <p class="greeting">Hi {{candidateName}},</p>

            <p>Thank you for taking the time to apply for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> position at <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>. It was a pleasure getting to know you and learning more about your background.</p>

            <p>While we were genuinely impressed by your skills, we have decided to move forward with another candidate whose experience more closely matches our current needs for this role.</p>

            <p>We deeply appreciate the effort you put into the interview process and your interest in joining our team. We wish you the absolute best in your career and future job search.</p>

            <div class="signature">
                Best regards,<br>
                <strong>{{senderName}}</strong><br>
                {{senderTitle}}, {{companyName}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>